-xz[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]File-aware syntax highlighting for the SASE pager[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Make source files, Markdown documents, and diffs quietly beautiful [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in every pager entry point while preserving source text, existing [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]styles, link actions, search, and responsiveness.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pager_filetype_syntax.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/pager_filetype_syntax.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-xz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-xz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared source-language policy and Python binding[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]language_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]language_contract: implement deterministic language selection, filename [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance, the additive Rust wire/API, and its thin Python facade with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding coverage. Do not activate rendering.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Offset-preserving syntax spans and adaptive palette[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]syntax_engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]syntax_engine: implement bounded Pygments token spans, corrected [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown frontmatter and fence offsets, source-style preservation, and a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]restrained theme-adaptive palette without activating a production call [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]site.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Responsive syntax composition and styled search[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reading_surface[dim] · [dim][/dim]after language_contract, syntax_engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reading_surface: implement optional section metadata, pump-free [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preparation, bounded caches, source-preserving label composition, styled[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]search, theme invalidation, and the language hint. Exercise explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test inputs while leaving existing producers inert.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Enable all pager entry points and verify the finished [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]experience[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]activate_and_verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after language_contract, syntax_engine, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]reading_surface[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]activate_and_verify: propagate real source provenance, support [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recognized source paths, add syntax controls and config, honor color [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]policy, document behavior, and complete functional, PNG, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]responsiveness verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-xz","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-xz.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0c686da52983cddc214c05bfe3a23464","started_at":"2026-09-07T14:53:20.647605+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"000b6c93074dde28147c46e1ccf0746432a544f623dc61c599775a0d6ccc4680"